  "title": "Kissed Velvety Slovakian Jerusalem Artichoke Toast",
  "description": "A jammy and velvety post-workout Slovakian dish featuring Jerusalem artichokes and toast, friendly to Buddhist temple diets. This dish is perfect for a snack after a workout.",
