  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "Toss the chopped Jerusalem artichokes with olive oil, salt, and black pepper on a baking sheet.",
    "Roast the Jerusalem artichokes in the oven for 20 minutes, or until tender.",
    "In a pan, saute the chopped onion and minced garlic until softened.",
    "Add the roasted Jerusalem artichokes to the pan and mash until velvety.",
    "Toast the bread slices until lightly browned.",
    "Spread the mashed Jerusalem artichoke mixture on the toast.",
    "Drizzle with lemon juice and serve."
